o/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine three Fulus into one evolved form with the merge machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yield, and powerful new battle options.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.poster.avif?t=1763462313\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.webm?t=1763462313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.mp4?t=1763462313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your playful Fulus out of trouble, look after them when they get mischievous, and make sure your lab stays a place where creatures feel happy and healthy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.poster.avif?t=1763462313\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.webm?t=1763462313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.mp4?t=1763462313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Monster Lab Simulator delivers the thrill of synthesis and battle, the joy of collection, and the magic of uncovering the unknown all inside your very own monster lab.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthesize essences to hatch unique monsters from eggs.</p></li><li><p cl